# Samodiva — binaries and networks

This repository contains **binaries and network files only**. The engine source
code is proprietary and deliberately not published.

## Ignore patterns

*.cpp
*.c
*.h
*.o
*.obj
*.py
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.bin
!*.nnue

## Build output that must never be committed

build/
build_tmp/
release/build/
out/
debug/
*.exe.tmp

## Local match data

match_*/
*.pgn
*.epd
stdout.txt
stderr.txt
*.log
*.pid
stats.json

## Training data and intermediate artefacts (tens of GB)

train*.bin
*.npy
*.jsonl
selected*.jsonl
games*.jsonl
holdout*.jsonl
__pycache__/
*.pyc

## Editor / OS

.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
